    "description": "Title\n: Peterson Pipe Of Dublin Smoking Pipe With Box Pouch And Brochure Brown Black\nBrand\n: Peterson\nColor\n: Brown and Black\nDepartment\n: For The Home\nCategory\n: Hard Goods\nCondition\n: Good - shows some sign of wear\nDescription\n: Discover sophistication with this Peterson of Dublin briar pipe, a premium tobacco pipe that combines a rich brown wood bowl with a sleek black stem featuring a silver band accent. This listing includes the original Peterson gift box, branded soft storage pouch, and an informational brochure  all bearing the distinctive Peterson branding established in 1865. The pipe's smooth finish highlights the natural grain of the wood, while the curved stem offers comfortable use. Made for both collectors and daily connoisseurs, this piece's craftsmanship ensures a reliable, stylish smoking experience. The included storage pouch helps protect the pipe from scratches and dust, while the sturdy box is ideal for gifting or secure keeping. Visuals show the bowl and stem in clean condition with minor surface marks consistent with light handling. Whether for display, collection, or personal use, this classic pipe stands as an elegant accessory with visible Peterson quality. All items photographed are included\nThis is a pre-owned item donated to Goodwill of Northern Michigan.\nPlease see images for further detail and ask any questions you may have before making a bid.\nItems have been tested for power, not function. In some instances we may not have the necessary equipment to test certain electronics therefore all items will be auctioned off AS-IS with no refunds.\nItems in lots are sold as-is, are not eligible for refunds, and may not be individually wrapped.\nPlease contact us before making payment to review combined shipping options.\nPick-Ups\nWe're open Monday - Friday, 8 am - 4 pm. We are closed on weekends and major holidays. For local pickup in Traverse City, please give us 24 hours from time of payment to prepare your order. Thank you!",
