    "description": "Mixed Mineral and Gemstone Collection\nAssorted Rough and Polished Stones\nLot of 26 Pieces\nThis varied mineral and gemstone lot features an eclectic assortment of rough specimens, polished tumbled stones, and lapidary carvings. Highlights include a carved green serpentine pyramid, rough agate and chert chunks, a natural pyrite cluster, and tumbled stones showing characteristic colors of amethyst, banded carnelian agate, sodalite, aventurine, and quartz. One small quartz point features an attached bail.\nDiverse mix of raw, tumbled, and carved stones\nDistinct colors ranging from earthy metallics to vibrant purple, blue, and green\nIdeal for lapidary study, crystal collections, wire-wrapping, or display\nCondition:\nGood pre-owned condition. Natural specimens show organic variations, surface fissures, and mineral inclusions typical of geological formations. Polished stones exhibit glossy finishes with light surface wear. Carved pyramid shows sharp facets with minor edge wear.\nTHANK YOU FOR SUPPORTING OUR MISSION!\nIf there is a problem with your order, please contact us via Shop Goodwill before opening returns/claims. We strive to respond to all inquiries within 2 business days.\nOur business hours are Monday - Friday  7:00 am to 3:00 pm EST\n**If your item was damaged in transit, do not throw away anything, including the box or packing materials until we have authorized you to do so.\n**Photos will be required to file insurance claims.\nGoodwill of Western and Northern Connecticut strengthens communities by helping people with disabilities and other disadvantages maximize independence through job training and other support services.",
